WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.507
Welcome to Sentinel Fleet.

2
00:00:01.507 --> 00:00:04.522
Let’s take a quick look at your fleet.

3
00:00:04.522 --> 00:00:09.421
The overview brings vehicle health, open alerts, and visible locations into one place.

4
00:00:09.421 --> 00:00:13.943
Refresh positions for a new demo update, then open the live map.

5
00:00:13.943 --> 00:00:17.334
For more detail, go to Vehicles and choose Telematics.

6
00:00:17.334 --> 00:00:22.610
Current state, trips, and tracker logs stay available—even if a vehicle later goes offline.
